# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately NOT ignored, and worth stating why:
#
#   DATA/kubernetes/          the corpus IS the product scope, so it is version
#                             controlled. Rebuild it with tools/fetch_corpus.py.
#   evals/dataset/            the golden dataset is ground truth; a change to it
#                             must show up in review like any other change.
#   evals/runs/               evaluation artifacts. Published numbers that
#                             nobody can re-open are not evidence, which is why
#                             the previous suite's results existed only in
#                             Streamlit session state.
#   evals/baseline*.json      the thresholds CI gates on.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The original filler corpus, superseded by the curated Kubernetes corpus.
DATA/noisy_data/
DATA/noisy_sample_10/
DATA/true_data/
